And it pretty well destroyed their manufacturing ability

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:47.000
And General Douglas MacArthur, who, by the way, was born here in Little Rock, and there's a MacArthur Museum downtown in Little Rock

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:53.000
Was one of the outstanding generals in the war

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:59.000
And President Truman, who had taken over from

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:02.000
President Roosevelt, who passed away in office

